# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT DATA — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GSWA drill-core packages. ~940 MB and growing, and it is the client's data.
# Anyone can regenerate it: download a zip from the NVCL THREDDS catalog.
data/
!data/
data/*
!data/README.md
*.zip
*.zip.part

# Raw HyLogger / spectral formats
*.tsg
*.bip
*.cal
*.dat
*.npz

# Material the client sent marked [SEC=OFFICIAL], plus course slides.
# Keep these out of version control entirely.
RE_ GSWA HyLogger Capstone*/
*.pdf
*.docx

